{
  "title": "Cantonese Class 廣東話課堂 – University Canteen 大學食堂",
  "image_caption": "Situation: students order food at self-service kiosks in the CityU canteen (城大食坊 City Express). 情境：學生喺大學食堂用自助點餐機叫嘢食。",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "cantonese": "呢度係城大食坊，有好多嘢食揀。",
      "jyutping": "ni1 dou6 hai6 sing4 daai6 sik6 fong1, jau5 hou2 do1 je5 sik6 gaan2.",
      "english": "This is the CityU canteen — there is lots of food to choose from.",
      "segments": [
        {"chinese": "呢度", "jyutping": "ni1 dou6", "english": "here"},
        {"chinese": "係", "jyutping": "hai6", "english": "is"},
        {"chinese": "城大食坊", "jyutping": "sing4 daai6 sik6 fong1", "english": "the CityU canteen"},
        {"chinese": "有好多", "jyutping": "jau5 hou2 do1", "english": "there are many"},
        {"chinese": "嘢食", "jyutping": "je5 sik6", "english": "food"},
        {"chinese": "揀", "jyutping": "gaan2", "english": "to choose"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "cantonese": "我哋喺自助點餐機度落單。",
      "jyutping": "ngo5 dei6 hai2 zi6 zo6 dim2 caan1 gei1 dou6 lok6 daan1.",
      "english": "We order at the self-service ordering kiosks.",
