      "jyutping": "dang2 zan6 go3 ping4 mok6 wui5 hin2 si6 nei5 go3 hou6 maa2.",
      "english": "In a moment the screen will show your number.",
      "segments": [
        {"chinese": "等陣", "jyutping": "dang2 zan6", "english": "in a moment"},
        {"chinese": "個屏幕", "jyutping": "go3 ping4 mok6", "english": "the screen"},
