        {"chinese": "你個號碼", "jyutping": "nei5 go3 hou6 maa2", "english": "your number"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "cantonese": "聽到叫號就去櫃檯攞嘢食。",
      "jyutping": "teng1 dou3 giu3 hou6 zau6 heoi3 gwai6 toi4 lo2 je5 sik6.",
      "english": "When you hear your number called, go to the counter to collect your food.",
