        {"chinese": "攞嘢食", "jyutping": "lo2 je5 sik6", "english": "collect your food"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "cantonese": "呢度啲嘢食又平又快，好多學生嚟食。",
      "jyutping": "ni1 dou6 di1 je5 sik6 jau6 peng4 jau6 faai3, hou2 do1 hok6 saang1 lei4 sik6.",
      "english": "The food here is cheap and fast — many students come to eat.",
      "segments": [
        {"chinese": "呢度啲嘢食", "jyutping": "ni1 dou6 di1 je5 sik6", "english": "the food here"},
